  "measures": [
    {
      "name": "Public Measure NC",
      "jurisdiction": "Kirkwood Community College (Merged Area X)",
      "ballotLanguage": "Shall Kirkwood Community College (Merged Area X) in the Counties of Benton, Black Hawk, Buchanan, Cedar, Clinton, Delaware, Dubuque, Iowa, Jackson, Jefferson, Johnson, Jones, Keokuk, Linn, Louisa, Poweshiek, Tama, and Washington, be authorized to renovate, improve, erect, and equip facilities to modernize learning spaces with an emphasis on health sciences, industrial technologies, agricultural sciences, and business and information technology, contract indebtedness therefor, and issue General Obligation Bonds in an amount not exceeding $88,000,000 for those purposes?"
    },
    {
      "name": "Public Measure CE",
      "jurisdiction": "Independence Community School District",
      "ballotLanguage": "Shall the Board of Directors of the Independence Community School District in the Counties of Buchanan and Benton, State of Iowa, be authorized to contract indebtedness and issue General Obligation Bonds in the amount not to exceed $24,990,000 to provide funds to build, furnish, and equip additions to East and West Elementary Schools; and to remodel, repair, improve, and equip East and West Elementary Schools and to improve the sites, including related demolition at West Elementary?"
    }
  ],
  "notes": "Supervisor seat is by district (only District 2 on the 2026 ballot; voters see only their district). No candidates filed for DEM Treasurer or DEM Attorney. SWCD To Fill Vacancy and Canton Township Trustee show 'No Candidate' (empty candidate arrays). Iowa Township Trustee is 'James Sayers' on the candidate list but 'Jim Sayers' in the official notice of election. Measures appear only on ballots in the respective districts. No county hospital trustee contest. Per-precinct sample ballots (36) are posted but were not parsed; data from official candidate lists and the 10/14/2026 notice of election."
